# Streamclone (core product)

Cursor-specific. Generic routing: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

## Scope

This public repo is the **self-hosted Twitch replica** only: directory, HLS playback, chat, emotes, desktop install.

StreamPulse backend, extension BFF, portal analytics, ingest, and hosted ops → private **streampulse-backend**, **streamclone-pulse**, or **streampulse-ops**. See [`docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md`](../../docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md).

