## Guardrails

- Route browser/probes through Caddy `http://localhost:8090`
- Never commit secrets, host IPs, or SSH paths to this public tree
- Narrow diffs — no drive-by refactors
- Legacy `internal/analytics/` may exist during split — do not extend from this rule surface
